me":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279128044,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkxMjgwNDQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/confirmed","name":"confirmed","color":"aaddaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":10,"created_at":"2025-02-17T21:13:36Z","updated_at":"2025-02-18T19:47:11Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in `4.3.stable`, `4.4.beta1`\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.beta1 - Windows 11 (build 22631) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1660 SUPER (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.6636) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-10700F CPU @ 2.90GHz (16 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nIf the user stops running a project by pressing the stop project hotkey (`F8` by default) from the game (not the editor), `EditorDebuggerSession`'s `stopped` signal fires twice consecutively. This creates asymmetry bugs where shutdown code in user plugins attempts to execute twice. Expected behaviour is for the signal to fire one time.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Open `test.tscn` in the attached project\n- Run the scene\n- Stop running the project using stop button or corresponding hotkey\n- Note the console has two print-outs for debug session stopping\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[bug-report-2.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18833012/bug-report-2.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102972/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102972/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}